OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start with the odd spot
OL,6,Fof light rain over the hills. Skies
OL,7,Fwill brighten by lunchtime, with sunny
OL,8,Fspells developing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Cooler than recently, but
OL,10,Fstill warm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA bright evening in the
OL,13,Fsouth, but cloud will quickly increase
OL,14,Felsewhere, bringing a few spots of
OL,15,Flight rain. Mostly overcast overnight,
OL,16,Fwith further patchy rain possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
