OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start with
OL,6,Fspots of rain. Breaks in the cloud
OL,7,Fwill allow some afternoon sunshine,
OL,8,Fthough warm and humid conditions may
OL,9,Ftrigger a few sharp showers later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,12,Fis likely to move across Wales on
OL,13,FTuesday, perhaps with some heavier
OL,14,Fbursts. Sunshine and showers on
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
